<section class="services animate">
    <div class="row has-divider">
        <div class="column col_title">
            <div class="title">
                <h2>Agency Snapshot</h2>
                <p>Strategy, identity, digital experience, content and technology for brands that need to perform.</p>
                <p class="light">We help organisations define what they stand for, express it clearly, and build the tools, campaigns and experiences that move audiences to act.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="column col_content top-space">
            <div class="flex-wrap">                
                <div class="card fade-up">
                    <h4>Brand strategy</h4>
                    <p class="small">We define the decisions that give a brand focus: positioning, audience, value proposition, architecture, messaging and roadmap. The result is a practical foundation for sharper communication and better growth.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card fade-up delay-400">
                    <h4>Brand Identity</h4>
                    <p class="small">We build complete identity systems across voice, visual language, logo, typography, colour, imagery and guidelines. Every element is designed to work consistently across digital, campaign and physical touchpoints.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card fade-up">
                    <h4>Consultancy</h4>
                    <p class="small">We advise leadership, marketing and product teams on brand direction, customer experience, digital systems and communications. Clear recommendations, strong thinking and work that can be put into market.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card fade-up delay-400">
                    <h4>Design</h4>
                    <p class="small">We design brand, campaign, product and publication systems that make information easier to understand and easier to act on. Our work balances clarity, craft and commercial purpose.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="card fade-up ">
                    <h4>Development</h4>
                    <p class="small">We turn design systems and product ideas into fast, reliable websites, applications and content platforms. Strategy, UX, interface design and engineering stay connected from brief to launch.</p>
                </div>

                
                <div class="card fade-up delay-400">
                    <h4>Production</h4>
                    <p class="small">We manage creative production across video, photography, motion, 3D, copy and campaign assets. From concept to post-production, we deliver content built for the channels where it needs to work.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card fade-up ">
                    <h4>Motion Design</h4>
                    <p class="small">We use animation, editing, sound and motion systems to make brands clearer, more distinctive and more useful across digital products, campaigns and social channels.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="card fade-up delay-400">
                    <h4>Content</h4>
                    <p class="small">We plan, write and produce content with a clear role in the customer journey. Messaging, copy, information architecture and assets are shaped to support brand and business goals.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card fade-up ">
                    <h4>Marketing</h4>
                    <p class="small">We create campaign platforms, launch activity, landing pages, advertising assets and marketing systems that connect creative direction with measurable action.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card fade-up delay-400">
                    <h4>AV</h4>
                    <p class="small">We develop film, sound, editing, motion and 3D assets for presentations, campaigns, environments and digital experiences where story needs to be seen and heard.</p>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

